	(text_box "R11 (0 Ω, DNP): bypass for payload switch U11\nWhen open (as built): payload on only when the Pi sets PAYLOAD_EN;\nU11 limits it to ~0.73 A and flags faults on PAYLOAD_FAULT (active low).\nWhen fitted: payload always on at bus voltage (VBUS);\nno switching, no current limit, no fault flag."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 54.61 276.86 0)
		(size 78.74 12.7)
